          "segments": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "These questions are designed to help Crews discuss the weekend teaching while building relationships with each other and applying God's Word to our lives. Aug  29/30 2026 What's one moment from this summer that you're especially grateful for? Describe your summer using three words. Looking back at your notes from this week's teaching, was there anything that particularly caught your attention, challenged you, or confused you? After reading "
            },
