              "type": "scripture",
              "displayText": "1 Corinthians 13",
              "reference": {
                "book": "1 Corinthians",
                "bookId": "1CO",
                "chapter": 13
              },
              "references": [
                {
                  "book": "1 Corinthians",
                  "bookId": "1CO",
                  "chapter": 13
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", what do you notice about the difference between being aligned with love and simply doing the right Christian things? How should what you've noticed shape the way you live out your faith? Read: "
            },
            {
              "type": "scripture",
              "displayText": "Colossians 3:1-4",
              "reference": {
                "book": "Colossians",
                "bookId": "COL",
                "chapter": 3,
                "verseStart": 1,
                "verseEnd": 4
              },
              "references": [
                {
                  "book": "Colossians",
                  "bookId": "COL",
                  "chapter": 3,
                  "verseStart": 1,
                  "verseEnd": 4
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ", "
            },
            {
              "type": "scripture",
              "displayText": "Matthew 6:33, 9:36, 22:37-40",
              "reference": {
                "book": "Matthew",
                "bookId": "MAT",
                "chapter": 6,
                "verseStart": 33
              },
              "references": [
                {
                  "book": "Matthew",
                  "bookId": "MAT",
                  "chapter": 6,
                  "verseStart": 33
                },
                {
                  "book": "Matthew",
